DESCRIPTION:Day of the Dead - Dia de Muertos - is the Mexican observance in
  which families welcome the dead back with home altars\, favorite foods\, 
 marigolds\, and visits to the cemetery. Events run on November 1 and 2\, a
 nd UNESCO added the festivity to its Representative List of the Intangible
  Cultural Heritage of Humanity in 2008.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.com/hol
 iday/day-of-the-dead/
